    <briefdescription>
<para>Class representing a 3D vector in <ref refid="classastrea_1_1astro_1_1Cartesian" kindref="compound">Cartesian</ref> coordinates. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class encapsulates a vector with three components (x, y, z) and provides various operations such as addition, subtraction, scalar multiplication, and dot/cross products.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>T</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The type of the vector components (e.g., Distance, Velocity). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
